    "description": {
      "value": "In a sudden burst of growth, you cause a thorned bush to sprout from the ground, lash around, and wither. Any creature in the area takes 1d4 piercing damage with a basic Reflex saving throw.\n\nUntil the start of your next turn, the area is difficult terrain and hazardous terrain. Any creature entering the square takes 1d4 piercing damage with a basic Reflex saving throw."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+2): The initial damage increases by 1d4, and the damage dealt by hazardous terrain increases by 1."
